      "title": "Editing Our First React App",
      "sourceHash": "e12c4df1dbcab388949016948e4a2a653b4391a697a1cff984727a22f8b6e5f1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.45,
          "end": 1.47,
          "en": "So now that we know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.47,
          "end": 4.95,
          "en": "why we might wanna use React instead of just JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.95,
          "end": 8.25,
          "en": "and before we start diving deeply into React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "and we'll learn it from the ground up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "I already wanna make sure that we get our hands dirty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 16.83,
          "en": "and that we actually start working on our first React app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.83,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "even though we don't really know a lot about React yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 22.65,
          "en": "But from what we've seen thus far,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.65,
          "end": 25.89,
          "en": "we might be able to solve the following tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.89,
          "end": 29.97,
          "en": "And it all starts with a new updated demo app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.97,
          "end": 32.25,
          "en": "And for that, attached to this lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.25,
          "end": 33.96,
          "en": "you find another link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.96,
          "end": 37.83,
          "en": "leading to another React web app on CodeSandbox.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.83,
          "end": 40.89,
          "en": "And of course, it's pretty much the same app as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 44.49,
          "en": "but I actually updated this content array here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.49,
          "end": 49.05,
          "en": "and I added a new fourth nested array in that content array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "And that fourth array inside of this content array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 54.9,
          "en": "will become important for this exercise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.9,
          "end": 56.73,
          "en": "which is why you should follow that link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.73,
          "end": 58.98,
          "en": "you find attached to this lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.98,
          "end": 60.93,
          "en": "Because in this updated app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.93,
          "end": 63.75,
          "en": "the goal now is to add a fourth button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.75,
          "end": 67.29,
          "en": "with any text of your choice, doesn't really matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.29,
          "end": 69.48,
          "en": "But when this fourth button is clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.48,
          "end": 71.31,
          "en": "the content for this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.31,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "so this fourth entry in this content array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.58,
          "end": 77.64,
          "en": "should be loaded and displayed on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.64,
          "end": 80.43,
          "en": "Now, implementing this, of course, will be challenging",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 82.77,
          "en": "because you don't really know React yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.77,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "despite the last lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "But definitely feel free to pause the video at this point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 90.93,
          "en": "and try solving these tasks on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.93,
          "end": 94.92,
          "en": "before then after a short pause, we'll solve it together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.92,
          "end": 97.22999999999999,
          "en": "If you can't solve it, by the way, no worries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.22999999999999,
          "end": 98.37,
          "en": "we're just getting started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.37,
          "end": 99.93,
          "en": "and you haven't learned React yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.93,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "so that's absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 104.02000000000001,
          "en": "But still, you might wanna give it a try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.77000000000001,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "So did you succeed? Let's try it together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 111.75,
          "en": "For this, of course, it's important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.75,
          "end": 113.75999999999999,
          "en": "that you're using this updated version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 115.11,
          "en": "which you find attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.11,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "where you do have this extra entry in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.22,
          "end": 122.73,
          "en": "And then with that, we can go down to the buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.73,
          "end": 125.52,
          "en": "and add another button here to this menu.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.52,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "And for that, I'll just copy one of the existing buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 131.61,
          "en": "and paste it in here, maybe at the end of the menu,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.61,
          "end": 133.623,
          "en": "but the exact position doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.73,
          "end": 139.07999999999998,
          "en": "And I'll give it a text of React vs JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.07999999999998,
          "end": 141.273,
          "en": "though that text, of course, is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 144.36,
          "en": "Now we got this button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 146.67000000000002,
          "en": "If I now click this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.67000000000002,
          "end": 149.37,
          "en": "I actually get a strange behavior though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 151.98,
          "en": "because now the third and the fourth button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.98,
          "end": 154.38,
          "en": "seem to be active simultaneously",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.38,
          "end": 158.61,
          "en": "and I do load the content of this third button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 158.61,
          "end": 161.67000000000002,
          "en": "Now, we do get this behavior here because, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.67000000000002,
          "end": 164.07,
          "en": "I copied this third button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 164.07,
          "end": 167.1,
          "en": "and I kept all the logic that was on this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.1,
          "end": 168.87,
          "en": "But now we need to adjust this logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 171.15,
          "en": "on this new fourth button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 171.15,
          "end": 173.64,
          "en": "For example, here, for this click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 173.64,
          "end": 176.97,
          "en": "in this function that's executed when that click occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 176.97,
          "end": 180.81,
          "en": "we should set the active content index to three",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 180.81,
          "end": 184.23,
          "en": "to select the fourth item in this content array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.23,
          "end": 185.7,
          "en": "Because as you know in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 185.7,
          "end": 188.07,
          "en": "arrays start with the index zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.07,
          "end": 190.89,
          "en": "so that in the end will make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 190.89,
          "end": 192.9,
          "en": "that we, for example, down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 192.9,
          "end": 195.69,
          "en": "will use the fourth item in this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 195.69,
          "end": 197.433,
          "en": "by using the index three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 198.78,
          "end": 199.82999999999998,
          "en": "Here in this condition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 199.82999999999998,
          "end": 203.25,
          "en": "we also should compare the active content index to three,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 203.25,
          "end": 205.89,
          "en": "therefore, to make sure that this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 205.89,
          "end": 207.75,
          "en": "only receives the active class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.75,
          "end": 210.66,
          "en": "if the content index is three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 210.66,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "And that actually is all then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 215.49,
          "en": "If you save that, maybe reload here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 215.49,
          "end": 217.41,
          "en": "though it shouldn't be required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 217.41,
          "end": 221.46,
          "en": "you should be able to now select this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 221.46,
          "end": 223.47,
          "en": "and see the content for this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 223.47,
          "end": 226.26,
          "en": "and have only that button being active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 226.26,
          "end": 228.9,
          "en": "So now all the buttons work as intended,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 228.9,
          "end": 230.76,
          "en": "this fourth button included.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 230.76,
          "end": 232.77,
          "en": "And therefore, we got our hands dirty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 232.77,
          "end": 236.16,
          "en": "We wrote our first lines of React code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 236.16,
          "end": 238.8,
          "en": "and we solved these tasks here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 238.8,
          "end": 240.27,
          "en": "And of course, as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 240.27,
          "end": 242.55,
          "en": "if you were not able to do this on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 242.55,
          "end": 245.82,
          "en": "that is absolutely fine and absolutely to be expected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 245.82,
          "end": 248.19,
          "en": "because you haven't even learned React yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 248.19,
          "end": 250.14,
          "en": "I haven't taught you React yet.",
